### ===========================================================================
### Todo API Interactive HTTP Tests
### ===========================================================================

@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. List All Todos (Empty or Initial List)
GET {{host}}/api/todos
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Create Todo 1 - Buy Groceries
POST {{host}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy groceries",
  "description": "Milk, eggs, and bread"
}

###

### 3. Create Todo 2 - Finish FX Ring Documentation
POST {{host}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Document fx.ring response combinators",
  "description": "Add ok>, created>, and bad-request> examples"
}

###

### 4. Create Todo 3 - Already Completed Item
POST {{host}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Set up Clojure deps",
  "description": "Initialize project structure",
  "completed": true
}

###

### 5. List All Todos
GET {{host}}/api/todos
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Filter Todos: Completed Only
GET {{host}}/api/todos?completed=true
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Filter Todos: Pending Only
GET {{host}}/api/todos?completed=false
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Get Todo by ID
GET {{host}}/api/todos/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Update Todo by ID
PUT {{host}}/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy groceries and coffee",
  "description": "Milk, eggs, sourdough bread, and dark roast coffee",
  "completed": false
}

###

### 10. Toggle Todo Completion Status
PATCH {{host}}/api/todos/1/toggle
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Delete Todo by ID
DELETE {{host}}/api/todos/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 12. Verify Deletion
GET {{host}}/api/todos/1
Accept: application/json

###

### ===========================================================================
### Error Handling & Validation Tests
### ===========================================================================

### Error: Validation Error - Missing/Empty Title (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "This should fail validation"
}

###

### Error: Not Found - Non-Existent ID (404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/todos/999999
Accept: application/json

###

### Error: Invalid ID Format (400 Bad Request)
GET {{host}}/api/todos/abc
Accept: application/json

###

### Error: Method Not Allowed (405)
POST {{host}}/api/todos/1/toggle
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}
